<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 187-9 V SRI LANKA - INNINGS CLOSED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 187-9 V SRI LANKA - INNINGS CLOSED.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe scored 187 for nine against Sri Lanka in the opening match of the Sharjah Cup limited overs tournament on Thursday.</p>
</text>
